## 🔑 Authentication APIs

All authentication endpoints are prefixed with `/api/auth`

### 1. Login Admin

**Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/login`

**Access**: Public

**Description**: Authenticate an admin user and receive a JWT token

**Request Body**:

```json
{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "your_password"
}
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
  "name": "Admin Name",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "role": "Admin",
  "profile_image": "https://example.com/images/profile.jpg",
  "is_active": true,
  "last_login": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z",
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
}
```

**Error Response** (401):

```json
{
  "message": "Invalid email or password"
}
```

**Error Response** (403 - Account Deactivated):

```json
{
  "message": "Account is deactivated. Contact administrator"
}
```

---

### 2. Register Admin

**Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/register`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Register a new admin user (only Super Admin can create new admins)

**Request Body**:

```json
{
  "name": "New Admin",
  "email": "newadmin@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123",
  "role": "Admin"
}
```

**Success Response** (201):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Admin registered successfully",
  "admin": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "name": "New Admin",
    "email": "newadmin@example.com",
    "role": "Admin"
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (403):

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Not authorized to access this route"
}
```

---

### 3. Get Profile

**Endpoint**: `GET /api/auth/profile`

**Access**: Protected (Any authenticated admin)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Get current authenticated admin's profile

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "admin": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "name": "Admin Name",
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "role": "Admin",
    "createdAt": "2025-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2025-01-15T10:30:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

---

### 4. Change Password

**Endpoint**: `PUT /api/auth/change-password`

**Access**: Protected (Any authenticated admin)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Change password for the authenticated admin

**Request Body**:

```json
{
  "currentPassword": "OldPassword123",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword456"
}
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Password changed successfully"
}
```

**Error Response** (401):

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Current password is incorrect"
}
```

---

### 5. Update Admin Role

**Endpoint**: `PUT /api/auth/admin/:id/role`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Promote an admin to Super Admin or demote to Admin

**Request Body**:

```json
{
  "role": "Super Admin"
}
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Admin role updated to Super Admin successfully",
  "admin": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "name": "Admin Name",
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "role": "Super Admin"
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (403):

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Cannot demote the last Super Admin"
}
```

---

### 6. Logout Admin

**Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/logout`

**Access**: Protected (Any authenticated admin)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Logout current admin session. Since JWT is stateless, the token should be removed client-side.

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Logged out successfully"
}
```

---

### 7. Refresh JWT Token

**Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/refresh`

**Access**: Protected (Any authenticated admin)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Refresh the JWT token for the authenticated admin. Returns a new token.

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
  "admin": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "name": "Admin Name",
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "role": "Admin",
    "profile_image": "https://example.com/images/profile.jpg"
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (403 - Account Deactivated):

```json
{
  "message": "Account is deactivated"
}
```

---

## 👥 Admin Management APIs

All admin management endpoints are prefixed with `/api/admins` and require **Super Admin** authentication.

### Available Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Access | Description |
|--------|----------|--------|-------------|
| **GET** | `/api/admins` | Super Admin Only | List all admin accounts with filtering |
| **POST** | `/api/admins` | Super Admin Only | Create a new admin account |
| **GET** | `/api/admins/:id` | Super Admin Only | View admin profile by ID |
| **PUT** | `/api/admins/:id` | Super Admin Only | Update admin details |
| **PATCH** | `/api/admins/:id/demote` | Super Admin Only | Demote admin / deactivate account |
| **DELETE** | `/api/admins/:id` | Super Admin Only | Delete admin account permanently |

---

### Admin Data Schema

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| **id** | UUID | Auto | Unique user identifier (primary key) |
| **name** | String | ✓ | Full name of the administrator |
| **email** | String | ✓ | Unique email address - used for login |
| **password** | String (hashed) | ✓ | bcrypt-hashed - never store plain text |
| **role** | Enum | ✓ | SUPER_ADMIN / ADMIN (default: ADMIN) |
| **profile_image** | String (URL) | | Profile picture URL |
| **is_active** | Boolean | Auto | Account active status (default: true) |
| **last_login** | DateTime | Auto | Timestamp of most recent login (ISO-8601) |
| **created_at** | DateTime | Auto | Account creation timestamp (ISO-8601) |
| **updated_at** | DateTime | Auto | Last update timestamp (ISO-8601) |

---

### 1. List All Admin Accounts

**Endpoint**: `GET /api/admins`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Query Parameters** (optional):

- `page` - Page number for pagination (default: 1)
- `limit` - Number of results per page (default: 10)
- `role` - Filter by role (Admin, Super Admin)
- `is_active` - Filter by active status (true, false)
- `search` - Search by name or email (partial match)

**Example Request**:

```
GET /api/admins?page=1&limit=10&role=Admin&is_active=true
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "count": 5,
  "totalResults": 12,
  "totalPages": 2,
  "currentPage": 1,
  "admins": [
    {
      "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
      "name": "John Doe",
      "email": "john@example.com",
      "role": "Admin",
      "profile_image": "https://example.com/images/john.jpg",
      "is_active": true,
      "last_login": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z",
      "createdAt": "2025-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

### 2. Create New Admin Account

**Endpoint**: `POST /api/admins`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Create a new admin user account. Only Super Admin can create new admins.

**Request Body**:

```json
{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123",
  "role": "Admin",
  "profile_image": "https://example.com/images/jane.jpg"
}
```

**Success Response** (201):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Admin account created successfully",
  "admin": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439012",
    "name": "Jane Smith",
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "role": "Admin",
    "profile_image": "https://example.com/images/jane.jpg",
    "is_active": true,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-17T11:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (400):

```json
{
  "message": "Admin with this email already exists"
}
```

---

### 3. View Admin Profile by ID

**Endpoint**: `GET /api/admins/:id`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Retrieve detailed information about a specific admin by their ID.

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "admin": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john@example.com",
    "role": "Admin",
    "profile_image": "https://example.com/images/john.jpg",
    "is_active": true,
    "last_login": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z",
    "createdAt": "2025-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (404):

```json
{
  "message": "Admin not found"
}
```

---

### 4. Update Admin Details

**Endpoint**: `PUT /api/admins/:id`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Update admin details including name, email, role, profile image, and active status. Partial updates supported.

**Request Body** (partial update supported):

```json
{
  "name": "John Doe Updated",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "role": "Super Admin",
  "profile_image": "https://example.com/images/john-new.jpg",
  "is_active": true
}
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Admin details updated successfully",
  "admin": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "name": "John Doe Updated",
    "email": "john.updated@example.com",
    "role": "Super Admin",
    "profile_image": "https://example.com/images/john-new.jpg",
    "is_active": true,
    "last_login": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T11:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (403):

```json
{
  "message": "Cannot demote the last Super Admin"
}
```

---

### 5. Demote Admin / Deactivate Account

**Endpoint**: `PATCH /api/admins/:id/demote`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Demote a Super Admin to Admin and deactivate their account. Prevents the last Super Admin from being demoted.

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Admin demoted and deactivated successfully",
  "admin": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john@example.com",
    "role": "Admin",
    "is_active": false
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (403):

```json
{
  "message": "Cannot demote the last Super Admin"
}
```

---

### 6. Delete Admin Account

**Endpoint**: `DELETE /api/admins/:id`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Permanently delete an admin account. Cannot delete the last Super Admin or your own account.

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Admin account deleted successfully"
}
```

**Error Response** (403 - Last Super Admin):

```json
{
  "message": "Cannot delete the last Super Admin"
}
```

**Error Response** (403 - Self Delete):

```json
{
  "message": "Cannot delete your own account"
}
```

---

## ⚽ Player Management APIs

All player endpoints are prefixed with `/api/players` and require authentication.

### Available Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Access | Description |
|--------|----------|--------|-------------|
| **GET** | `/api/players` | Admin & Super Admin | List all players with filtering (age_group, position, gender) |
| **POST** | `/api/players` | Admin & Super Admin | Create a new player profile |
| **GET** | `/api/players/search` | Admin & Super Admin | Search players by name, city, age group, or position |
| **GET** | `/api/players/:id` | Admin & Super Admin | Retrieve a single player profile |
| **PUT** | `/api/players/:id` | Admin & Super Admin | Update player profile |
| **DELETE** | `/api/players/:id` | Super Admin Only | Delete player (soft delete) |

---

### Player Data Schema

Complete field descriptions for player profiles:

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| **name** | String | ✓ | Full name of the player |
| **age** | Integer | | Age in years (5-100) |
| **age_group** | String | | Age category: U13, U15, U17, U19, Senior |
| **playingPosition** | String | ✓ | Primary playing position (e.g., Striker, Midfielder, Goalkeeper) |
| **alternativePosition** | String | | Secondary position player can perform |
| **preferredFoot** | Enum | | Left / Right / Both |
| **transferMarketLink** | String (URL) | | Link to player's Transfermarkt profile |
| **playerId** | String | ✓ | Unique player identifier |
| **dateOfBirth** | Date | ✓ | Birth date (ISO-8601 format) |
| **nationality** | String | | Player nationality / country |
| **weight** | Number | | Weight in kilograms |
| **height** | Number | | Height in centimeters |
| **gender** | Enum | ✓ | Male / Female / Other |
| **jersey_no** | Integer | | Assigned jersey number (0-99) |
| **size** | Enum | | Jersey size: XS / S / M / L / XL / XXL |
| **city** | String | | Player's city of residence |
| **address** | String | | Full residential address |
| **mobileNumber** | String | ✓ | Contact phone number |
| **email** | String | ✓ | Contact email address (unique) |
| **profileImage** | Array[String] | | Profile photos stored as URLs (cloud storage) |
| **scouting_notes** | Text | | Scout observations and performance notes |
| **career_history** | Text | | Previous clubs, academies, career timeline |
| **media_links** | Array[String] | | URLs to videos, highlight reels, documents |
| **clubsPlayed** | Array[Object] | | Previous clubs with logos and duration |
| **clubsPlayed.clubName** | String | ✓ | Name of the club |
| **clubsPlayed.clubLogo** | String (URL) | | Club logo image URL |
| **clubsPlayed.duration** | String | | Period played (e.g., "2015-2018") |
| **createdBy** | ObjectId | | Reference to Admin who created the record |
| **updatedBy** | ObjectId | | Reference to Admin who last updated |
| **isDeleted** | Boolean | | Soft delete flag |
| **createdAt** | DateTime | Auto | Record creation timestamp |
| **updatedAt** | DateTime | Auto | Last update timestamp |

---

### 1. Create Player

**Endpoint**: `POST /api/players`

**Access**: Admin & Super Admin (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Create a new player profile

**Request Body**:

```json
{
  "name": "Cristiano Ronaldo",
