## � Blogs & Articles APIs

Blog endpoints are prefixed with `/api/blogs`. Public routes (published content) are accessible without authentication, while admin routes require authentication.

### Available Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Access | Description |
|--------|----------|--------|-------------|
| **GET** | `/api/blogs` | Public | List all published articles (public-facing) |
| **GET** | `/api/blogs/all` | Admin & Super Admin | List all articles including drafts |
| **POST** | `/api/blogs` | Admin & Super Admin | Create a new article |
| **GET** | `/api/blogs/:id` | Public | Retrieve a single article by ID or slug |
| **PUT** | `/api/blogs/:id` | Admin & Super Admin | Update article content or status |
| **PATCH** | `/api/blogs/:id/publish` | Admin & Super Admin | Toggle article status to PUBLISHED |
| **DELETE** | `/api/blogs/:id` | Super Admin Only | Delete article permanently |

---

### Blog Data Schema

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| **id** | ObjectId | Auto | Unique article identifier (primary key) |
| **title** | String | ✓ | Article or blog post title |
| **slug** | String | Auto | URL-friendly title identifier (auto-generated) |
| **content** | Text (HTML) | ✓ | Full article body content (rich text / HTML) |
| **excerpt** | String | | Short preview / summary (max 300 characters) |
| **author_id** | ObjectId (FK) | ✓ | Foreign key referencing Admin.id |
| **cover_image** | String (URL) | | Cover image URL - stored in cloud image storage |
| **tags** | Array<String> | | Topic tags (e.g. 'scouting', 'transfers', 'U17') |
| **status** | Enum | | DRAFT / PUBLISHED / ARCHIVED (default: DRAFT) |
| **published_at** | DateTime | Auto | Publish timestamp (ISO-8601); null if draft |
| **created_at** | DateTime | Auto | Record creation timestamp (ISO-8601) |
| **updated_at** | DateTime | Auto | Last update timestamp (ISO-8601) |

---

### 1. Create Blog/Article

**Endpoint**: `POST /api/blogs`

**Access**: Admin & Super Admin (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Create a new blog post or article. Slug is auto-generated from title if not provided.

**Request Body**:

```json
{
  "title": "Top 10 Young Talents to Watch in 2026",
  "content": "<h1>Introduction</h1><p>In the world of football scouting...</p>",
  "excerpt": "Discover the most promising young football talents that scouts should be watching in 2026.",
  "cover_image": "https://example.com/images/young-talents-2026.jpg",
  "tags": ["scouting", "youth", "talents", "2026"],
  "status": "DRAFT"
}
```

**Success Response** (201):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Blog created successfully",
  "blog": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "title": "Top 10 Young Talents to Watch in 2026",
    "slug": "top-10-young-talents-to-watch-in-2026",
    "content": "<h1>Introduction</h1><p>In the world of football scouting...</p>",
    "excerpt": "Discover the most promising young football talents...",
    "author_id": {
      "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439012",
      "name": "Scout Admin",
      "email": "scout@example.com",
      "role": "Admin"
    },
    "cover_image": "https://example.com/images/young-talents-2026.jpg",
    "tags": ["scouting", "youth", "talents", "2026"],
    "status": "DRAFT",
    "published_at": null,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

---

### 2. Get All Blogs (Including Drafts)

**Endpoint**: `GET /api/blogs/all`

**Access**: Admin & Super Admin (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Query Parameters** (optional):

- `page` - Page number for pagination (default: 1)
- `limit` - Number of results per page (default: 10)
- `status` - Filter by status (DRAFT, PUBLISHED, ARCHIVED)
- `tags` - Filter by tags (comma-separated, e.g., "scouting,youth")
- `author_id` - Filter by author ID
- `title` - Search by title (partial match)

**Example Request**:

```
GET /api/blogs/all?status=PUBLISHED&tags=scouting,youth&page=1&limit=10
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "count": 3,
  "totalResults": 25,
  "totalPages": 3,
  "currentPage": 1,
  "blogs": [
    {
      "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
      "title": "Top 10 Young Talents to Watch in 2026",
      "slug": "top-10-young-talents-to-watch-in-2026",
      "excerpt": "Discover the most promising young football talents...",
      "author_id": {
        "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439012",
        "name": "Scout Admin",
        "email": "scout@example.com",
        "role": "Admin"
      },
      "cover_image": "https://example.com/images/young-talents-2026.jpg",
      "tags": ["scouting", "youth", "talents", "2026"],
      "status": "PUBLISHED",
      "published_at": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-17T09:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

### 3. Get Published Blogs (Public)

**Endpoint**: `GET /api/blogs`

**Access**: Public (No authentication required)

**Query Parameters** (optional):

- `page` - Page number for pagination (default: 1)
- `limit` - Number of results per page (default: 10)
- `tags` - Filter by tags (comma-separated)

**Description**: Retrieves only published blogs, sorted by publication date (newest first). This endpoint is publicly accessible.

**Example Request**:

```
GET /api/blogs?tags=scouting&page=1&limit=10
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "count": 5,
  "totalResults": 15,
  "totalPages": 2,
  "currentPage": 1,
  "blogs": [
    {
      "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
      "title": "Top 10 Young Talents to Watch in 2026",
      "slug": "top-10-young-talents-to-watch-in-2026",
      "excerpt": "Discover the most promising young football talents...",
      "author_id": {
        "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439012",
        "name": "Scout Admin",
        "email": "scout@example.com"
      },
      "cover_image": "https://example.com/images/young-talents-2026.jpg",
      "tags": ["scouting", "youth", "talents", "2026"],
      "status": "PUBLISHED",
      "published_at": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

### 4. Get Single Blog

**Endpoint**: `GET /api/blogs/:identifier`

**Access**: Public (No authentication required)

**Description**: Get a single blog by ID or slug. You can use either the MongoDB ObjectId or the URL-friendly slug. This endpoint is publicly accessible.

**Example Requests**:

```
GET /api/blogs/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
GET /api/blogs/top-10-young-talents-to-watch-in-2026
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "blog": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "title": "Top 10 Young Talents to Watch in 2026",
    "slug": "top-10-young-talents-to-watch-in-2026",
    "content": "<h1>Introduction</h1><p>In the world of football scouting...</p>",
    "excerpt": "Discover the most promising young football talents...",
    "author_id": {
      "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439012",
      "name": "Scout Admin",
      "email": "scout@example.com",
      "role": "Admin"
    },
    "cover_image": "https://example.com/images/young-talents-2026.jpg",
    "tags": ["scouting", "youth", "talents", "2026"],
    "status": "PUBLISHED",
    "published_at": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z",
    "createdAt": "2026-02-17T09:00:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (404):

```json
{
  "message": "Blog not found"
}
```

---

### 5. Update Blog/Article

**Endpoint**: `PUT /api/blogs/:id`

**Access**: Admin & Super Admin (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Update blog fields. When status changes to PUBLISHED, `published_at` is automatically set.

**Request Body** (partial update supported):

```json
{
  "title": "Updated: Top 10 Young Talents to Watch in 2026",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "tags": ["scouting", "youth", "talents", "2026", "updated"]
}
```

