  "success": true,
  "message": "Blog updated successfully",
  "blog": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "title": "Updated: Top 10 Young Talents to Watch in 2026",
    "slug": "updated-top-10-young-talents-to-watch-in-2026",
    "status": "PUBLISHED",
    "published_at": "2026-02-17T11:00:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T11:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

---

### 6. Toggle Publish Status

**Endpoint**: `PATCH /api/blogs/:id/publish`

**Access**: Admin & Super Admin (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Toggle article status to PUBLISHED. This endpoint sets the blog status to "PUBLISHED" and automatically updates the `published_at` timestamp.

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Blog published successfully",
  "blog": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "title": "Top 10 Young Talents to Watch in 2026",
    "slug": "top-10-young-talents-to-watch-in-2026",
    "status": "PUBLISHED",
    "published_at": "2026-02-17T11:00:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T11:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (404):

```json
{
  "message": "Blog not found"
}
```

---

### 7. Delete Blog/Article

**Endpoint**: `DELETE /api/blogs/:id`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Soft delete a blog/article. Only Super Admins have delete privileges.

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Blog deleted successfully"
}
```

**Error Response** (404):

```json
{
  "message": "Blog not found"
}
