## 🏢 About Me / Organisation APIs

The About endpoint manages the organisation profile as a **singleton** (only one record exists). Public access for viewing, Super Admin only for updates.

### Available Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Access | Description |
|--------|----------|--------|-------------|
| **GET** | `/api/about` | Public | Retrieve organisation profile (public-facing) |
| **PUT** | `/api/about` | Super Admin Only | Update organisation profile |
| **POST** | `/api/about/images` | Super Admin Only | Upload new gallery images |

---

### About Data Schema

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| **id** | ObjectId | Auto | Singleton record identifier (primary key) |
| **org_name** | String | ✓ | Organisation / academy name |
| **mission** | Text | | Mission statement |
| **history** | Text | | Background and history of the organisation |
| **credentials** | Text | | Achievements, affiliations, certifications |
| **contact_email** | String | | Public contact email address |
| **contact_phone** | String | | Public contact phone number |
| **location** | String | | City / region |
| **images** | Array<String> | | Gallery image URLs - stored in cloud image storage |
| **social_links** | Object | | Social media links (instagram, facebook, twitter, youtube) |
| **updated_at** | DateTime | Auto | Last update timestamp (ISO-8601) |
| **created_at** | DateTime | Auto | Record creation timestamp (ISO-8601) |

---

### 1. Get Organisation Profile

**Endpoint**: `GET /api/about`

**Access**: Public (No authentication required)

**Description**: Retrieve the organisation profile. This is a singleton resource - only one organisation profile exists. If no profile exists, a default one is automatically created.

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "about": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "org_name": "Pro-Talent Connect",
    "mission": "Discover and connect with the best football talents worldwide.",
    "history": "Founded in 2020, Pro-Talent Connect has become the leading platform for football scouting and talent management.",
    "credentials": "Licensed by FIFA, UEFA affiliated, ISO 9001 certified",
    "contact_email": "info@protalent.com",
    "contact_phone": "+1-555-0123",
    "location": "London, United Kingdom",
    "images": [
      "https://example.com/images/facility-1.jpg",
      "https://example.com/images/facility-2.jpg",
      "https://example.com/images/team-photo.jpg"
    ],
    "social_links": {
      "instagram": "https://instagram.com/protalentconnect",
      "facebook": "https://facebook.com/protalentconnect",
      "twitter": "https://twitter.com/protalentconnect",
      "youtube": "https://youtube.com/@protalentconnect"
    },
    "createdAt": "2025-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T10:30:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

---

### 2. Update Organisation Profile

**Endpoint**: `PUT /api/about`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Update the organisation profile. Only Super Admin can update the profile. Partial updates are supported (only send fields you want to update).

**Request Body** (partial update supported):

```json
{
  "org_name": "Pro-Talent Connect Academy",
  "mission": "Empowering young athletes to reach their full potential through world-class scouting and development programs.",
  "history": "Founded in 2020 by former professional footballers, Pro-Talent Connect has grown to become a global leader in football talent identification and management.",
  "credentials": "Licensed by FIFA, UEFA affiliated, ISO 9001 certified, Winner of Best Scouting Platform 2025",
  "contact_email": "contact@protalent.com",
  "contact_phone": "+44-20-1234-5678",
  "location": "London, United Kingdom",
  "social_links": {
    "instagram": "https://instagram.com/protalentconnect",
    "facebook": "https://facebook.com/protalentconnect",
    "twitter": "https://twitter.com/protalentconnect",
    "youtube": "https://youtube.com/@protalentconnect"
  }
}
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Organisation profile updated successfully",
  "about": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "org_name": "Pro-Talent Connect Academy",
    "mission": "Empowering young athletes to reach their full potential...",
    "history": "Founded in 2020 by former professional footballers...",
    "credentials": "Licensed by FIFA, UEFA affiliated, ISO 9001 certified...",
    "contact_email": "contact@protalent.com",
    "contact_phone": "+44-20-1234-5678",
    "location": "London, United Kingdom",
    "images": [
      "https://example.com/images/facility-1.jpg",
      "https://example.com/images/facility-2.jpg"
    ],
    "social_links": {
      "instagram": "https://instagram.com/protalentconnect",
      "facebook": "https://facebook.com/protalentconnect",
      "twitter": "https://twitter.com/protalentconnect",
      "youtube": "https://youtube.com/@protalentconnect"
    },
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T11:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

