### 3. Upload Gallery Images

**Endpoint**: `POST /api/about/images`

**Access**: Super Admin Only (Protected)

**Headers**:

```
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
```

**Description**: Add new images to the organisation's gallery. Images are appended to the existing array. Duplicate URLs are automatically prevented.

**Request Body**:

```json
{
  "images": [
    "https://example.com/images/new-facility.jpg",
    "https://example.com/images/training-ground.jpg",
    "https://example.com/images/awards-ceremony.jpg"
  ]
}
```

**Success Response** (200):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "3 image(s) added to gallery",
  "about": {
    "_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
    "org_name": "Pro-Talent Connect",
    "images": [
      "https://example.com/images/facility-1.jpg",
      "https://example.com/images/facility-2.jpg",
      "https://example.com/images/team-photo.jpg",
      "https://example.com/images/new-facility.jpg",
      "https://example.com/images/training-ground.jpg",
      "https://example.com/images/awards-ceremony.jpg"
    ],
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T11:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response** (400):

```json
{
  "message": "Please provide an array of image URLs"
}
```

