## �🔒 Authentication & Authorization

### JWT Token Format

After successful login, you'll receive a JWT token. Include it in all protected requests:

```
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
```

### Role-Based Access

- **Public Routes**:
  - `POST /api/auth/login` - Login
  - `GET /api/blogs` - List all published articles
  - `GET /api/blogs/:id` - View single published article
  - `GET /api/about` - View organisation profile

- **Super Admin Only**:
  - `POST /api/auth/register` - Register new admins
  - `PUT /api/auth/admin/:id/role` - Promote/demote admin roles
  - `GET /api/admins` - List all admin accounts
  - `POST /api/admins` - Create new admin account
  - `GET /api/admins/:id` - View admin profile by ID
  - `PUT /api/admins/:id` - Update admin details
  - `PATCH /api/admins/:id/demote` - Demote/deactivate admin
  - `DELETE /api/admins/:id` - Delete admin account
  - `DELETE /api/players/:id` - Delete player profiles
  - `DELETE /api/blogs/:id` - Delete blog/article posts
  - `PUT /api/about` - Update organisation profile
  - `POST /api/about/images` - Upload gallery images

- **Admin & Super Admin** (Authenticated):
  - `POST /api/auth/logout` - Logout current session
  - `POST /api/auth/refresh` - Refresh JWT token
  - `GET /api/auth/profile` - View profile
  - `PUT /api/auth/change-password` - Change password
  - `POST /api/players` - Create player profiles
  - `GET /api/players` - List all players (filterable)
  - `GET /api/players/search` - Search players by criteria
  - `GET /api/players/:id` - View player details
  - `PUT /api/players/:id` - Update player profiles
  - `GET /api/blogs/all` - List all articles including drafts
  - `POST /api/blogs` - Create blog/article posts
  - `PUT /api/blogs/:id` - Update blog/article posts
  - `PATCH /api/blogs/:id/publish` - Toggle publish status
  - `GET /api/dashboard/stats` - View dashboard statistics

